  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Spring Fill the Clinic with Cape CARES</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cape CARES clinics have treated families and communities for three generations, making us one of the oldest NGO&apos;s in Honduras! Returning to each community multiple times a year has allowed for Cape CARES to build a team-centered primary care practice that provides medical and dental treatment, follow up care, preventive care, health education, and community needs assessments. Our largest cost is pharmaceuticals and supplies. That is where you come in.</narrative>
  </description>
